{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"3f5b39eb02d7a1d6766cabadd5a21eb777a96ecc4aafa2082814665aaa8ba329","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["年轻时要记住你的创造主，不要等到衰老的岁月来临时才哀叹：“我的日子毫无乐趣。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时，太阳、月亮、星星都暗淡无光，雨后乌云再现；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["守卫家园的手脚颤抖，强壮的身躯变得弯腰驼背；牙齿稀少，无法咀嚼；视力衰退，看不清楚；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耳朵发背，听不到推磨声；小鸟一叫，人就起来；歌声沙哑，不再美妙；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["惧怕高处，走路战战兢兢；头发白如银杏，精力枯竭，欲望荡然无存；人都走向永远的归宿，吊丧的人往来于街上；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["银链断裂，金碗摔坏，泉旁的瓶子破碎，井口的轮子朽烂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那时尘土必归回大地，灵也要归回赐灵的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["传道者说：“虚空的虚空，一切都是虚空。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["传道者不但有智慧，还把知识传授给众人。他经过细心推敲和研究之后，编写了许多警世的箴言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["传道者费尽心思寻找金玉良言，所写的都是正直诚实的道理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["智者的言语好像赶牛的刺棍，他们收集的箴言像钉牢的钉子，都是一位牧者所赐的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我亲爱的儿子，还有一件事，你要听我的忠告：著书多，没有穷尽；读书多，身体疲劳。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["以上所说的，总而言之，就是要敬畏上帝，遵守祂的诫命，这是人的本分。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["因为人一切的行为，无论善恶，包括一切隐秘事，上帝都必审问。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/SNG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}